This appears to be Smṛtijñānakīrti a student of  Nāropa (ID:5639).</note></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3761"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">abhidharmakośakārikā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">abhidharmakośakārikā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos mngon pa'i mdzod kyi tshig le'ur byas pa</title><author ref="person:3758">vasubandhu</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">3761</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4779"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mdor bsdus thal 'gyur phreng ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">མདོར་བསྡུས་ཐལ་འགྱུར་ཕྲེང་བ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">thal phreng mdor bsdus pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1371-01-01" notAfter="1438-12-31">after 1371 before 1438</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Commentary on the Pramāṇaviniścaya (ID:3774) addressing about fourteen points (with mention of words from the corresponding passage of the Pramāṇaviniścaya) in the form of chains of arguments by consequence, with abundant use of the pronoun “khyod.” &#13;
&#13;
[8H6M69W4] does not mention an author for instance (ID:4778), but the previous two works, which have the same folio size and script, as well as the same double numbering of the folios, are by Zwha lu rin chen bsod nams 'phel (ID:4129). The authorship is likely the same for this work, which adopts a similar style of presentation as other works by Zhwa lu rin chen bsod nams, several of which have the expression "phreng" in their title.&#13;
&#13;
This work could correspond to the items No. 11847-11848 listed by A khu shes rab rgya mtsho in the Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 675, No. 11847: zhwa lu rin chen bsod nams 'phel gyi rnam nges sbyor Tik gzhan phan nor phreng le'u gnyis pa yan, and No. 11848: gzhan don le'u'i rnam bzhag). &#13;
It could also correspond to No. 11849: tshad ma'i thal phreng mdor bsdus (or this item could correspond to (ID:5306)).&#13;
&#13;
The work is mistakenly ascribed to bSam gtan bzang po (ID:4005) in the [UJDXNMGD] due to a fragment of the latter's epistemological commentary (see work (ID:6010)) being copied at the end of the work in instance (ID:4778).</note><idno type="APIS">4779</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5188"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phar phyin gyi thal phreng bsdus pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཕར་ཕྱིན་གྱི་ཐལ་ཕྲེང་བསྡུས་པ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phar phyin gyi thal phreng bsdus pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1371-01-01" notAfter="1438-12-31">after 1371 before 1438</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">This might correspond to No. 11534 or No. 11536 listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 530, No. 11534: zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel gyi phar phyin sbyor Tik mkhas pa dga' byed; No. 11536: phar phyin thal phreng nyung du le tshan).</note><idno type="APIS">5188</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5306"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bsdus chos nor bu'i phreng ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">བསྡུས་ཆོས་ནོར་བུའི་ཕྲེང་བ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bsdus chos nor bu’i phreng ba</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1428-01-01" notAfter="1428-12-31">1428</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Work on the theory of definition composed in thal 'phreng (chains of consequences) style, without citations or references to other works and scholars.&#13;
&#13;
It could correspond to the "tshad ma'i thal phreng mdor bsdus" listed in the Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 675, No. 11849). &#13;
&#13;
The colophon gives the date of composition as: sa pho spre'u'i la nag pa'i zla ba'i gnam (The year of the male earth monkey, in the waxing moon of the third month. As the author would only have been 7 years old in 1368, 1428 is more likely.</note><idno type="APIS">5306</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5495"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mngon pa mdzod kyi rnam bshad sde bdun gsal ba'i sgron me</title><title xml:lang="bo">མངོན་པ་མཛོད་ཀྱི་རྣམ་བཤད་སྡེ་བདུན་གསལ་བའི་སྒྲོན་མེ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mngon pa mdzod kyi rnam bshad gsal ba'i sgron me</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1411-01-01" notAfter="1411-12-31">1411</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">This work is listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 532, No. 11686: zhwa lu rin chen bsod nams 'phel gyi mdzod kyi rnam bshad sde bdun gsal ba'i sgron me).&#13;
Date of composition: lcags mo yos kyi lo'i zla ba dad po'i tshes gcig (in the year of the iron-female rat, on the first day of the first Tibetan month)</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3761"/><respStmt><resp>prompter</resp><name ref="person:6981">dge 'dun mgon</name></respStmt><idno type="APIS">5495</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5497"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos mngon pa'i mdzod kyi sbyor ba'i Ti ka mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཆོས་མངོན་པའི་མཛོད་ཀྱི་སྦྱོར་བའི་ཊི་ཀ་མཁས་པའི་ཡིད་འཕྲོག</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mdzod kyi sbyor Tik mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mngon mdzod kyi sbyor ba'i Ti ka mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dam pa'i chos mngon pa mdzod kyi sbyor ba'i TI ka mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1433-01-01" notAfter="1433-12-31">1433</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Commentary in the form of thal-phyir arguments.&#13;
It corresponds to the work listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 532, No. 11687: [zhwa lu rin chen bsod nams 'phel gyi] mdzod kyi sbyor Tik mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog).&#13;
Date of composition: chu mo glang gi zla ba dang po'i tshes brgyad (in the year of the female water ox, on the eighth day of the first Tibetan month).</note><idno type="APIS">5497</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5499"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dam pa'i chos mdzod kyi dka' ba'i gnas kyi zin bris mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog</title><title xml:lang="bo">དམ་པའི་ཆོས་མཛོད་ཀྱི་དཀའ་བའི་གནས་ཀྱི་ཟིན་བྲིས་མཁས་པའི་ཡིད་འཕྲོག</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mdzod kyi dka' 'grel mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1430-01-01" notAfter="1430-12-31">1430</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">This work is listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 532, no. 11687: [zhwa lu rin chen bsod nams 'phel gyi] mdzod kyi dka' 'grel mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog).&#13;
&#13;
Date of composition indicated in the colophon in (ID:5498), fol. 175b6-7: dkar rtsid pa'i lugs kyi ¦ thun mong gi lo ¦ nag rtsis pa'i lugs kyi ¦ lung pho khyi'i lo ¦ ston zla 'bring po tha skar zla ba'i chos lnga. This corresponds to 1430.</note><idno type="APIS">5499</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work6872"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phar phyin gyi sbyor ba'i TI ka mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཕར་ཕྱིན་གྱི་སྦྱོར་བའི་ཊཱི་ཀ་མཁས་པའི་ཡིད་འཕྲོག</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phar phyin sbyor Tik mkhas pa dga' byed</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1371-01-01" notAfter="1438-12-31">after 1371 before 1438</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">This is possibly the same work as the "phar phyin sbyor Tik mkhas pa dga' byed" listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 530, no. 11534: zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel gyi phar phyin sbyor Tik mkhas pa dga' byed).&#13;
&#13;
Maybe the same work as (ID:5188).</note><idno type="APIS">6872</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work6873"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">don bdun cu'i sa mtshams</title><title xml:lang="bo">དོན་བདུན་ཅུའི་ས་མཚམས</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1371-01-01" notAfter="1438-12-31">after 1371 before 1438</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">False</note><note type="comment">Listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 530, no. 11535: don bdun cu'i sa mtshams).</note><idno type="APIS">6873</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work6874"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phar phyin thal phreng nyung du le tshan</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཕར་ཕྱིན་ཐལ་ཕྲེང་ཉུང་དུ་ལེ་ཚན</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1111-01-01" notAfter="1175-12-31">after 1111 before 1175</date><author ref="person:4129">zhwa lu pa rin chen bsod nams 'phel ba</author><note type="isExtant">False</note><note type="comment">Listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 530, No. 11536: phar phyin thal phreng nyung du le tshan).</note><idno type="APIS">6874</idno></bibl></listBibl><listPlace><place xml:id="place4350"><placeName xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhwa lu</placeName><placeName xml:lang="bo">ཞྭ་ལུ</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">zhwa lu dgon</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dpal zha lu'i gtsug lag khang</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">zhal lu</placeName><location><geo>29.12783 88.99262</geo></location><idno type="APIS">4350</idno></place><place xml:id="place5719"><placeName xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'de re lung gi brag phug</placeName><placeName xml:lang="bo">འདེ་རེ་ལུང་གི་བྲག་ཕུག</placeName><idno type="APIS">5719</idno></place></listPlace><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel2326" name="other-relation-to" active="#person5985" passive="#person4129" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="re